      "writtenOn": "2021-12-03T20:44:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For counter keys that log very frequently, (eg, a code snippet running every minute), by having a buffer, we\u0027ll call stats_log 4-5 times for thoses key instead of thousands of times per day. \n\nLet\u0027s say that we have 100 counters and each of them will call Count() for 100 times per day:\n\nWith the buffer, the events generated will be 5 * number of counter keys \u003d 500.\nWithout the buffer, the events generated will be the sum of all Count() \u003d 10000.",
